569725665882181_5181980931331754088_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2I0z5pOJWacQ7kNvwHdC2HR&_nc_oc=AdqXDW4MdS4h2XDNpy_zw2MbGn_gK5OsqiT2iYS5zTLKdLeOhoSdM4lOT0-29u1-pT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9mJPTRi8Hrp1SpPbGNyGlU5M7gxVgt80-SjOL7Dgyw2Q&oe=6A33F18B"}, "display_name": "Alcove Sanctuary", "keywords": ["alcove", "wellness", "mindfulness", "nova", "travel"], "long_description": "# From the team who brought you Alcove, welcome to your Sanctuary. \n\nWith experiences designed to connect you to the world and pique your curiosity, embedded in a new space with fresh ways to make it your own - we hope Sanctuary will become your home away from home. \n\n* Customize your sanctuary with shared photos, uploaded videos - and now, generative AI features to create art and sculpt new furnishings.\n* Travel the world, from iconic landmarks to your own childhood neighborhood. \n* Relax and practice meditation in nature - guided, or unguided.\n* Listen to classical music.\n\n...plus, you'll have access to your own friendly companion along the way.\n\n# Meet Nova! \n\nNova brings a whole new level of creativity and interaction to Alcove. You can have a conversation with Nova in real-time to generate stunning images, craft custom 3D models, search for experiences, explore the world, or simply connect and chat.\n\n**All of this and more is available with a Sanctuary+ subscription.**\n\nWe can't wait to see what you come up with.", "short_description": "Alcove Sanctuary is your gateway to boundless exploration, education, and experiences in VR. And now you can meet Nova, your AI companion designed to guide you through a world of discovery, memories, and entertainment \u2014 all in one personalized experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rendever.com/alcove/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.rendever.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Rendever, Inc", "suppo